<ptxt>
Slipping
</ptxt>
</condition>
<ps>
<ptxt>
Improper clutch pedal free travel
</ptxt>
</ps>
<action>
<ptxt>
Replace clutch pedal arm and/or clutch master cylinder.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Clutch pedal arm: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5306016"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Clutch master cylinder: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5306011"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</action>
<ps>
<ptxt>
